          "note": "Proto-Balto-Slavic *dū́ˀmas; Proto-Slavic *dỳmъ shows the same d."
        },
        {
          "from": "PIE *médʰu 'honey, mead' (Sanskrit mádhu)",
          "to": "medùs 'honey'"
        }
